ictionary: Start a match off with your own personally submitted words</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple Languages: Experience Tricky Typing in all 3 languages of the world: English, French, and Spanish</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dyslexic Font: If you have dyslexia, then the included font, <i>Open Dyslexic</i>, may be for YOU!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adjustable Game Speed: Whether at half speed or 150%, play the game how you want to</li></ul>",
